#: source/workflows/index.rst:4
msgid "Workflows"
msgstr "工作流程"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:6
msgid ""
"A workflow is a packaged way to run Isaac Lab somewhere other than a local "
"Python environment. The task code, the configuration, and the command line "
"stay the same; only the environment that executes them changes. Use this "
"section once Isaac Lab runs locally through :ref:`isaaclab-installation-"
"root` and you need a reproducible environment, a job scheduler, or a remote "
"GPU."
msgstr ""
"工作流将 Isaac Lab 打包，使其能在本地 Python 环境之外运行。任务代码、配置和命令行保持相同，改变的是执行它们的环境。通过 "
":ref:`isaaclab-installation-root` 在本地运行成功后，如果需要可复现环境、作业调度器或远程 GPU，可使用本节。"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"Every workflow below starts from the same container image, so they build on "
"each other: the cluster workflow converts that image to Apptainer, and the "
"cloud workflow provisions a machine that runs it."
msgstr "以下工作流均以同一容器镜像为基础，逐层扩展：集群工作流将镜像转换为 Apptainer，云工作流配置运行镜像的机器。"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:18
msgid "Docker"
msgstr "Docker"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:22
msgid ""
"Build and run Isaac Lab in a container for a reproducible environment on any"
" Docker host. **Start here** -- the other two workflows build on this image."
msgstr "在容器内构建和运行 Isaac Lab，为任意 Docker 宿主机提供可复现环境。 **从这里开始** ，另外两种工作流都基于此镜像。"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:25
msgid "HPC clusters"
msgstr "HPC 集群"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:29
msgid ""
"Convert the container to an Apptainer image and submit jobs through SLURM, "
"PBS, or OSMO."
msgstr "将容器转换为 Apptainer 镜像，通过 SLURM、PBS 或 OSMO 提交作业。"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:31
msgid "Cloud workstations"
msgstr "云端工作站"

#: source/workflows/index.rst:35
msgid ""
"Provision a GPU workstation on AWS, GCP, Azure, or Alibaba Cloud with Isaac "
"Automator."
msgstr "使用 Isaac Automator，在 AWS、GCP、Azure 或阿里云上配置 GPU 工作站。"
